<title>USA: Chittenango CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Chittenango CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc said it won $4.125 million of Chittenango Central School District, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
